<title>USA: HFB Financial sets 5-for-3 stock split.</title>
<headline>HFB Financial sets 5-for-3 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MIDDLESBORO, Ky. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>HFB Financial Corp said Tuesday that it declared a five for three stock split in the form of a 66-2/3 percent common stock dividend.</p>
<p>HFB said the dividend is payable June 30 to stockholders of record June 15 and said it will pay cash in lieu of fractional shares.</p>
<p>HFB is the holding company for Home Federal Bank serving eastern Kentucky and northeastern Tennessee. It had assets of $155.5 million at March 31.</p>
</text>
